          "chapter": 15,
          "verses": [
            14
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Fulfillment of Prophecy",
      "description": "Shallum's brief reign and violent death were part of the fulfillment of the Lord's word to Jehu that his descendants would sit on Israel's throne for four generations.",
